  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Well, hello! You’re Emma’s new helper, I take it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C002000680065006C006C006F002100200059006F007520190072006500200045006D006D0061201900730020006E00650077002000680065006C007000650072002C00200049002000740061006B0065002000690074003F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, then—let me get right to my request!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002C0020007400680065006E2014006C006500740020006D0065002000670065007400200072006900670068007400200074006F0020006D007900200072006500710075006500730074002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see, I’m terribly interested in Pokémon\nEvolution.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007300650065002C002000492019006D0020007400650072007200690062006C007900200069006E0074006500720065007300740065006400200069006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A00450076006F006C007500740069006F006E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re familiar with how Pokémon evolve, yes?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey transform and grow strong by gaining\nExp. Points in battle, becoming close to their<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTrainers... All sorts of ways!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 176
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Out of all the Evolution methods out there, I’m\nmost taken by those that require items to induce...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I went to all sorts of effort to get myself such\nan item—in this case, a Thunder Stone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But there’s just one unfortunate problem...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002000740068006500720065201900730020006A0075007300740020006F006E006500200075006E0066006F007200740075006E006100740065002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t have a single Pokémon that requires a\nThunder Stone to evolve!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I did a little research, and it seems a Pokémon\ncalled Pikachu would be just what I need.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So here’s my request—please give me a Pikachu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200068006500720065201900730020006D00790020007200650071007500650073007420140070006C0065006100730065002000670069007600650020006D006500200061002000500069006B0061006300680075002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You won’t walk away empty-handed, of course.\nI’d be happy to trade you my Heracross!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you get a Pikachu for me, I’ll give you my\nHeracross in return!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI hear Pikachu can be found in Wild Zone 3.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Could it be that you already have a Pikachu\nfor me?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’d love to trade you my Heracross and take that\nPikachu off your hands, if you wouldn’t mind.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure thing!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007200650020007400680069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hang on a moment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061006E00670020006F006E002000610020006D006F006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So you were happy to hear out my request, but\nyou draw the line at trading with me?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat, did you just want to show off your Pikachu\nor something?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wonderful! Let’s get trading, then!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F006E00640065007200660075006C00210020004C00650074201900730020006700650074002000740072006100640069006E0067002C0020007400680065006E002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome to the family, Pikachu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C0063006F006D006500200074006F0020007400680065002000660061006D0069006C0079002C002000500069006B0061006300680075002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As a little nice-to-meet-you gift, please allow me\nto use this Thunder Stone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goodness me! Pikachu evolved into Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F0064006E0065007300730020006D00650021002000500069006B0061006300680075002000650076006F006C00760065006400200069006E0074006F0020005200610069006300680075002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s see what sort of Pokémon Raichu is, shall\nwe? According to my Pokédex...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nit stores up electricity inside itself, then turns so\naggressive that it may attack its Trainer...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 185
    },
    {
      "displayText": "G-gosh... Well, I know the Thunder Stone isn’t the\nonly stone that makes Pokémon evolve.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThere are plenty of others out there to find!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, thanks ever so much for your help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0079007700610079002C0020007400680061006E006B00730020006500760065007200200073006F0020006D00750063006800200066006F007200200079006F00750072002000680065006C0070002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do give Emma my regards, won’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F0020006700690076006500200045006D006D00610020006D007900200072006500670061007200640073002C00200077006F006E2019007400200079006F0075003F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heraaa!",
